From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] drm/bridge: dw-hdmi: Attach the content type property

The AVI InfoFrame of dw-hdmi never carries an IT content type, so a
sink cannot switch to a mode suited to graphics, photos, cinema or
games on the source's request. Attach the "content type" property and
fill the IT content and content type fields from it, forcing a mode
set when it changes as the InfoFrame is only written then.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c
index cf7df73..8546100 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/synopsys/dw-hdmi.c
@@ -1897,6 +1897,8 @@ static void hdmi_config_AVI(struct dw_hdmi *hdmi,
 	else
 		frame.colorspace = HDMI_COLORSPACE_RGB;
 
+	drm_hdmi_avi_infoframe_content_type(&frame, connector->state);
+
 	/* Set up colorimetry */
 	if (connector->colorspace_property &&
 	    connector->state->colorspace != DRM_MODE_COLORIMETRY_DEFAULT) {
@@ -2690,7 +2692,8 @@ static int dw_hdmi_connector_atomic_check(struct drm_connector *connector,
 	 */
 	if (!drm_connector_atomic_hdr_metadata_equal(old_state, new_state) ||
 	    old_state->colorspace != new_state->colorspace ||
-	    old_state->hdmi.broadcast_rgb != new_state->hdmi.broadcast_rgb) {
+	    old_state->hdmi.broadcast_rgb != new_state->hdmi.broadcast_rgb ||
+	    old_state->content_type != new_state->content_type) {
 		crtc_state = drm_atomic_get_crtc_state(state, crtc);
 		if (IS_ERR(crtc_state))
 			return PTR_ERR(crtc_state);
@@ -2759,6 +2762,7 @@ static int dw_hdmi_connector_create(struct dw_hdmi *hdmi)
 
 	drm_connector_attach_max_bpc_property(connector, 8, 16);
 	drm_connector_attach_broadcast_rgb_property(connector);
+	drm_connector_attach_content_type_property(connector);
 
 	/*
 	 * The output format is only negotiated when a bridge in front of
